[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#e67e22]🗡️ WHAT IS CUSTOMDUNGEONS?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=3]
[B]CustomDungeons[/B] is an entirely rewritten, high-performance, modular dungeon manager designed for server owners who demand smooth performance, deep RPG mechanics, and zero clutter. 
Whether you want to build multi-stage catacombs, puzzle-filled crypts, or epic boss arenas with wave defense, CustomDungeons gives you complete control without requiring third-party library dependencies!
[/SIZE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#3498db]✨ KEY FEATURES[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Multi-Stage Progression:[/B] Create progression chains where players must slay monsters, survive wave timers, or activate arcane triggers to unlock the next chamber.
[*][B]In-World Interactive Structures:[/B] Configure custom loot chests, mimic monster traps, mob spawners, and automated stage gates.
[*][B]Interactive Arcane Puzzles:[/B] Engage player minds with sequence memory buttons and combination dial locks.
[*][B]Smart Arena Rollback:[/B] Any block broken or placed during dungeon sessions is logged and cleanly restored instantly upon completion or failure.
[*][B]Party & Matchmaking Queue:[/B] Players can invite friends, manage party teams, and enter matchmaking queues with automatic instance start.
[*][B]Class Loadouts & Kits:[/B] Equip players with custom classes (Warrior, Ranger, Mage) upon dungeon arrival.
[*][B]Custom Weighted Loot Engine:[/B] Configure reward chests and completion tables with drop probabilities, min/max amounts, and enchantments.
[*][B]Zero External Dependencies:[/B] Comes with an internal high-speed GUI menu engine out of the box!
[*][B]PlaceholderAPI & Vault Hook:[/B] Display remaining lives, timers, party members, and monetize dungeon entrances with entry fees.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#9b59b6]📜 COMMANDS & PERMISSIONS SUMMARY[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH][COLOR=#f39c12]Command[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#f39c12]Description[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#f39c12]Permission[/COLOR][/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd menu[/B][/TD]
[TD]Opens the GUI Dungeon Selection Menu[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.user.menu[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd list[/B][/TD]
[TD]Shows all available dungeons in chat[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.user.list[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd join <name>[/B][/TD]
[TD]Join a dungeon or queue[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.user.join[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd leave[/B][/TD]
[TD]Forfeit and leave current dungeon[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.user.leave[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd party[/B][/TD]
[TD]Manage or create your party team[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.party[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd loot[/B][/TD]
[TD]Open the reward claim chest[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.loot[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd loadout[/B][/TD]
[TD]Open the class loadout selection[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.loadout[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd admin reload[/B][/TD]
[TD]Reload all configurations and dungeons[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.admin.reload[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd admin setlobby <name>[/B][/TD]
[TD]Set lobby location to current position[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.admin.setup[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd admin setspawn <name>[/B][/TD]
[TD]Set battle spawn to current position[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.admin.setup[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][B]/cd admin setexit <name>[/B][/TD]
[TD]Set exit location to current position[/TD]
[TD]customdungeons.admin.setup[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

